jobInfo.postDescription:
岗位职责：
1. Manage online maintenance technicians;
管理在线维护技术员;
2. Improve ICT/FCT coverage and increase pass rates;
改善ICT/FCT的覆盖率并提高通过率; 
3. Conduct online acceptance of new ICT and FCT fixtures and submit GR&R reports;
新的ICT、FCT治具在线验收,并提交GR&R的报告;
4. Troubleshoot all test platforms;
所有测试平台的故障排除; 
5. Debug test programs and fixtures;
调试测试程序及夹具;
6. Maintain test fixtures and equipment, and specify maintenance plans;
测试夹具及设备维护并指定维护计划.
7. Debug test fixtures and write test programs，
调试测试夹具和编写测试程序; 
8. Optimize test fixtures and automation, and develop improvement plans;
针对测试夹具及自动化进行优化,制定改善计划; 
9. Develop new test methods for new test projects;
为新的测试项目开发新的测试方法; 
10. Generate test coverage reports for all products;
为所有产品生成测试覆盖报告;
11. Collect and analyze all test data required by customers;
提供客户需求的所有测试数据收集和分析
12.Analyze defective products, down to the component level
对不良品进行分析,可以细化到元件级别
13. Be able to read and understand mechanical drawings and circuit diagrams;
能够阅读和理解机械制图和电路图;
14. Conduct failure analysis of electrical or mechanical components;
电气或机械部件的失效分析;
15. Use oscilloscopes, voltmeters, and microscopes for measurements;
使用示波器、电压计和显微镜进行测量;
16. Understand SMT process flow and be familiar with failure modes of commonly used components;
了解SMT工艺流程,熟悉常用元器件的失效模式;
17. Be able to use X-Ray for auxiliary analysis.
会使用X-Ray辅助分析.

岗位要求：
1. Bachelor's degree in Electrical/Electronic/Mechanical Engineering;
本科学历，电气/电子/机械工程专业;
2. At least 2 years of experience in test maintenance;
至少2年的测试维护经验;
3. Familiar with ICT/FCT testing methods and testing equipment;
熟悉ICT/FCT测试方法及测试设备;
4.Familiar with the debugging of test systems for RF and microphone functions; 
熟悉射频和麦克风功能的测试系统调试.
5. Over 1 year of experience in FPC/FPCA/PCBA or related fields;
1年以上FPC /FPCA/PCBA或相关领域的工作经验; 
6. Good English listening, speaking, writing, and computer skills;
良好的英语听说写能力，良好的计算机技能;
7. Proficient in CAD and CAM software;
熟练CAD和CAM软件;
8. Innovative, capable of generating test solutions for various new projects;
创新,为各种新项目生成测试解决方案;
9. Understand electrical schematic diagrams and able to generate test solutions to ensure test coverage;
理解电气原理图并能生成测试解决方案以确保测试覆盖率。
10.Good written and spoken English skills; 
良好的英语书面和口头表达能力； 
11. Background in electronic manufacturing (preferably PCBA or PCB);
电子制造背景（首选PCBA或PCB); 
12. At least 2 years of experience in test analysis within an electronic manufacturing company.
至少2年电子制造公司测试分析工作经验.
